---
const { airports, title='15 家机场' }=Astro.props;
---
<aside class="airport-quick-sidebar"><span class="eyebrow">QUICK INDEX</span><h2>{title}</h2><p>点击名称查看对应机场的完整资料。</p><nav>{airports.map(a=><a href={`/rankings/#airport-${a.data.rank}`}><span>{String(a.data.rank).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div><b>{a.data.name}</b><small>{a.data.price===null?'价格待核实':`¥${a.data.price}/月起`} · {a.data.oneTime}</small></div></a>)}</nav><div class="quick-note"><b>查看完整榜单</b><p>独立排行榜包含定位、适合人群、核验说明和购买风险提示。</p></div></aside><style>.airport-quick-sidebar{position:static;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(15,23,42,.05);overflow:hidden}.airport-quick-sidebar h2{font-size:23px;margin:4px 0}.airport-quick-sidebar>p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 13px}.airport-quick-sidebar nav{display:block}.airport-quick-sidebar nav a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:27px 1fr;gap:8px;padding:9px 3px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);min-height:52px}.airport-quick-sidebar nav a:hover b{color:var(--brand)}.airport-quick-sidebar nav span{font-size:11px;font-weight:900;color:var(--brand)}.airport-quick-sidebar nav b{font-size:12px}.airport-quick-sidebar nav small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:9px}.quick-note{background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;padding:11px;margin-top:13px}.quick-note b{font-size:11px}.quick-note p{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin:3px 0 0}</style>
